{"props":{"name":"[Rerun] Lone Trail Rerun","poster":"/event-poster/[Intermezzo – Celebration] Lone Trail.webp","images":["/event-poster/[Intermezzo – Celebration] Lone Trail.webp"],"artAspect":"1024 / 328","dateRange":"2024/11/21–2024/12/01","isPredicted":false,"bannerName":null,"bannerImage":null,"lineupPending":null,"featuredOperators":[],"skins":[{"name":"Habitat","series":"EPOQUE","seriesImage":"/skin-series-logos/EPOQUE.webp","code":"EPOQUE Collection New Arrivals/Habitat","model":"Silence the Paradigmatic","illustrator":"九日九号","description":"Silence's dress for public events. She's been busy of late, and drifts to sleep in front of the camera. Luckily, she has Ifrit 's handmade alarm clock to help her stay awake.","release":"Lone Trail Rerun","howToObtain":"Outfit Store ( 18 Originite Prime )","image":"/six-star-skins/Silence the Paradigmatic - Habitat.webp","fashionReviewDate":"2026/12/23","skinId":"char_1031_slent2@epoque#32"},{"name":"Born as One","series":"Bloodline of Combat","seriesImage":"/skin-series-logos/Bloodline of Combat.webp","code":"Bloodline of Combat Collection/Born as One","model":"Specter the Unchained","illustrator":"Skade","description":"An engraving leaves a shadow, like two sides of a coin, or the cycle of day and night. When both are aware of their dual nature, Laurentina possesses a soul most complete, like unto the twin moons.","release":"Lone Trail","howToObtain":"Outfit Store ( 21 Originite Prime )","image":"/six-star-skins/Specter the Unchained - Born as One.webp","skinId":"char_1023_ghost2@boc#6"},{"name":"Golden Dream","series":"Ambience Synesthesia","seriesImage":"/skin-series-logos/Ambience Synesthesia.webp","code":"Ambience Synesthesia Tailor-Provided/Golden Dream","model":"Lumen","illustrator":"一千","description":"Lumen's casual leisure wear, tailored for elegance from lightweight materials. The sea mist has lifted, and you can now see the lighthouse without binoculars.","release":"Lone Trail","howToObtain":"Outfit Store ( 18 Originite Prime )","image":"/six-star-skins/Lumen - Golden Dream.webp","fashionReviewDate":"2026/01/16","skinId":"char_4042_lumen@ambienceSynesthesia#3"},{"name":"Eine Variation","series":"Bloodline of Combat","seriesImage":"/skin-series-logos/Bloodline of Combat.webp","code":"Bloodline of Combat Collection/Eine Variation","model":"Ebenholz","illustrator":"竜崎いち","description":"A traditional-style gown worn by every Graf Urtica, now draped over Ebenholz's shoulders. Orders apathetically seep from the tip of the staff, piercing through the sparse ensemble of nobles.","release":"Lone Trail","howToObtain":"Outfit Store ( 18 Originite Prime )","image":"/six-star-skins/Ebenholz - Eine Variation.webp","fashionReviewDate":"2026/01/16","skinId":"char_4046_ebnhlz@boc#6"},{"name":"Remnant","series":"Bloodline of Combat","seriesImage":"/skin-series-logos/Bloodline of Combat.webp","code":"Bloodline of Combat Collection/Remnant","model":"Kal'tsit","illustrator":"红色彗星","description":"Originium has taken over the land, and what she envisioned has become a reality. She has enumerated and entrusted everything else to the others, leaving only her name as she hones her mission into a sharp blade.","release":"Lone Trail","howToObtain":"Outfit Store ( 24 Originite Prime )","image":"/six-star-skins/Kal'tsit - Remnant.webp","skinId":"char_003_kalts@boc#6"},{"name":"Ten Thousand Mountains","series":"Bloodline of Combat","seriesImage":"/skin-series-logos/Bloodline of Combat.webp","code":"Bloodline of Combat Collection/Ten Thousand Mountains","model":"Ch'en the Holungday","illustrator":"唯@W","description":"Ch'en Hui-chieh entered the capital on a starry night, and left before sunrise after settling matters. She bid farewell to old friends and took a sampan down the river, the lamp on the prow crashing through the fog and night.","release":"Lone Trail","howToObtain":"Outfit Store ( 21 Originite Prime )","image":"/six-star-skins/Ch'en the Holungday - Ten Thousand Mountains.webp","skinId":"char